                                <span class="text-xl">🔔</span>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 block">Notification Chime (OGG/WAV)</span>
                                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">HQ Sound Effect</span>
